# --- secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# .env holds the Neo4j password and the LLM API key. It has never been
# committed on this repo (verified against the full history) - keep it that way.
# .env.example is the template and MUST stay tracked, hence the negation: the
# `.env.*` line above it would otherwise swallow it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json

# --- virtual environments ----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
build/
dist/

# --- retrieval artifacts: deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored ----------------
# Semantic_Analysis/artifacts/ is intentionally committed so a clone does not
# need to run 01_build_index.py (up to 25 min) before working - important for
# SIH demo reliability. Re-run the build and recommit if
# IS_Standards_Data/standards.csv changes, or if is_advisor/config.py names a
# different BI_ENCODER: the loader compares the text fingerprint *and* the
# encoder name recorded in index_meta.json, and falls back to keyword-only
# rather than erroring, so a missed recommit degrades quietly instead of
# breaking loudly.
#
# The binary patterns below are for indexes built *outside* that directory - a
# stray embeddings.npy elsewhere is still 35 MB of derived data - so the
# committed artifacts are re-included immediately after them. Without those two
# negations, `git add` would silently refuse the very files we mean to track.
*.npy
*.pkl
*.parquet
*.faiss
!Semantic_Analysis/artifacts/
!Semantic_Analysis/artifacts/**

# --- model caches ------------------------------------------------------------
# Only bites if HF_HOME or TRANSFORMERS_CACHE is pointed inside the repo. The
# checkpoints are gigabytes: NLLB-200 is 2.5 GB, multilingual-e5-small 0.5 GB.
.cache/
models--*/
*.safetensors
*.gguf

# --- editors and operating systems -------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- logs and scratch --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
scratch/
tmp/

# --- local agent instructions ------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
